        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\n5 BED / 4 BATH HOME \r\nWELL PRESENTED THROUGHOUT \r\nIDYLLIC END OF CUL DE SAC POSITION\r\nADJACENT TO LARGE GREEN\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES \r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED....\r\n\r\nA beautiful home in a wonderful position….\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Clonsilla Property Specialists are truly delighted to present No. 26 to the Dublin 15 Property Market. \r\n\r\nPorters Gate is a most prestigious development of homes and No. 26 is tucked away offering privacy and seclusion yet with every conceivable amenity on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nNo. 26 is sure to impress , investors, first time buyers and parties trading up alike. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe extra spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance hall, guest toilet, living room, kitchen / dining / family room, utility room and bedroom / office with en suite. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms to include primary en suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThere is also an attic ideal for conversion.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this lovely home include: Quality flooring throughout, modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, doors leading to back garden, fitted wardrobes in three of the bedrooms & quality tiling and sanitary ware in all bathrooms.\r\n\r\nNo. 26 is a most energy efficient home with very low running costs\r\nboasting double glazed windows and energy efficient central heating system together with optimum insulation throughout.\r\n\r\nThere is a large private driveway leading to side entrance. To the rear is a private east facing garden.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport.\r\n\r\nClonee, Dunboyne, Clonsilla, Ongar & Blanchardstown Villages & Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nD. 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by.\r\n\r\nThe Pheonix Park and Castleknock Village are within a 15 minute drive. The property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. \r\n\r\nThe area is further serviced by an excellent bus route together with Clonsilla Train Station making the city most accessible. The M50 / M3 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
